"The Leading Knife is a Knife Meister skill."
"Every knifelike object in range turns the same way as the glowing orange lead blade."
"Once the lead is thrown, servant blades chase it like a flock in a large sphere behind it."
"It can turn arrows the wrong way."
"It activates with a whisper; the holder can recall the lead knife and sense its direction blind."
"Darts made to resist it do not follow the lead blade."
